"P2183564633" "Ah, the Abyssal Tome. It preserves many nearly forgotten rituals, preventing them from passing into oblivion. The Legacy Chain must have thought they could harness its power. They are fools - I'm glad I let it fall into their possession."
// RandomFameString :
