// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2535431567" "I have consulted the Abyssal Tome you acquired from the Legacy Chain, and found there the components necessary to forge the Blackwand. Once the Blackwand is created, we shall gain much power.<br><br>First, we must harvest the primordial essence contained within the manifestions known as Slag Golems. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Defeat 20 Slag Golems and return to me with the coral shard fragments they possess</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P2907139236" "Harvest coral from Slag Golems"
// SendOffString :
"P2818163820" "The creatures you hunt are animated by the power of the coral shards, mere automatons. Be swift and merciless."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P718582578" "You do not possess what I seek. Go forth and gather the coral shards."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

