"P2823019302" "You harvested enough coral shards!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2633276660" "And to think that these mere shards were once part of an entity so great... 'tis no matter."
// RandomFameString :
"P35862720" "{VillainName} wiped out a bunch of these freaky Slag Golems. Good riddance to 'em, I say!"

