"P2040634727" "The components for the Blackwand ritual are almost complete! The Abyssal Tome, Coral Shards, Blood of Mu and Mu Relics have been gathered by you, and it comes time for one last task. The soul of a hero is full of potential, capable of achieving great things and changing the course of the world. A soul like this has great power... power we can harness for ourselves! <A HREF={ACCEPT}Go to a Longbow base and retrieve the soul essence of a defeated hero</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P3106196004" "Gather soul essence of defeated hero"
// SendOffString :
"P1351393449" "Once the hero is defeated, reciting an incantation of a soul crystal will gather his essence."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3388375256" "This is the last component needed to forge the Blackwand. Seek it out!"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P397691594" "<color deepskyblue>Part Five</color>"

